# Erasure scheduler (S11 step 07) — every 15 minutes. Executes approved
# erasure requests whose grace period elapsed; re-runs crashed executions
# (idempotent by design). Install on the ops host crontab (compose stays
# infra-only per CLAUDE.md).
*/15 * * * * cd /opt/medical-dictation-backend && /usr/local/bin/uv run --project services/core-service python scripts/jobs/erasure_scheduler.py >> /var/log/mdx/erasure-scheduler.log 2>&1
